# Only submission source and documentation are versioned at the root.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/package.json
!/experiments/
!/docs/

/experiments/*
!/experiments/pickup-board/
!/experiments/pickgo-navigation/
/experiments/pickup-board/emulator-preview/
/experiments/pickgo-navigation/*.py

/docs/*
!/docs/showcase/
!/docs/IMPLEMENTATION_STATUS.md
!/docs/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
/docs/showcase/*
!/docs/showcase/USER_GUIDE.md
!/docs/showcase/DEMO_SCRIPT.md
!/docs/showcase/VERIFICATION.md
!/docs/showcase/screenshots/
!/docs/showcase/video/

# Machine configuration, build output and credentials are never submitted.
**/.gradle/
**/build/
**/local.properties
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/credentials*.json
**/service-account*.json
**/secrets.*
*.keystore
*.jks
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
